{"5418530":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Retro Coder 2000","steam_appid":5418530,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >His room. His rent. His machine.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levan has been gone for nineteen days. All he left is a 90s PC that still dials in and still gets job offers. Maybe the work pays the rent. Maybe it leads to him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/e930f479724e41cc9b3208325484fe19.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/e930f479724e41cc9b3208325484fe19.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A real computer, not a menu<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BIOS, floppy drives that grind, a dot-matrix printer that feeds your notes, a modem that screams on dial-up. Upgrade the CPU, video card and hard disk, and watch slideshows turn smooth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/4246ea4f7ec4380df0ee408cd05a4288.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/4246ea4f7ec4380df0ee408cd05a4288.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take his jobs<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix clients' broken programs in a built-in language, crack ciphers, repair databases. Invoices pay late, clients get rude, some get strange. Keep your reputation, and keep the rent paid.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go underground<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way onto a network that isn't on any directory. Break into servers through deduction puzzles, not luck: sniff traffic, read logs, crack passwords. Buy the tools, earn your Cred, and don't get traced.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/4a7c7b8fe8bcca1f2a8205a01ae31c69.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/4a7c7b8fe8bcca1f2a8205a01ae31c69.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A living 90s net<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of sites, chat rooms full of arguments, newsletters, spam, dodgy downloads and the viruses that come with them.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your own games<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D, tile maps or full 3D in the same language. Pack them onto floppies and share them. Everything you make stays compatible with future updates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/57c6289a7f7e1b3872072b51bb01f9c1.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/57c6289a7f7e1b3872072b51bb01f9c1.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop or VR<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play flat with mouse and keyboard, or sit at the desk in VR.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your PC belongs to VRK Systems. So does the world outside.<\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >His room. His rent. His machine.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levan has been gone for nineteen days. All he left is a 90s PC that still dials in and still gets job offers. Maybe the work pays the rent. Maybe it leads to him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/e930f479724e41cc9b3208325484fe19.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/e930f479724e41cc9b3208325484fe19.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A real computer, not a menu<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BIOS, floppy drives that grind, a dot-matrix printer that feeds your notes, a modem that screams on dial-up. Upgrade the CPU, video card and hard disk, and watch slideshows turn smooth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/4246ea4f7ec4380df0ee408cd05a4288.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/4246ea4f7ec4380df0ee408cd05a4288.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take his jobs<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix clients' broken programs in a built-in language, crack ciphers, repair databases. Invoices pay late, clients get rude, some get strange. Keep your reputation, and keep the rent paid.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go underground<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way onto a network that isn't on any directory. Break into servers through deduction puzzles, not luck: sniff traffic, read logs, crack passwords. Buy the tools, earn your Cred, and don't get traced.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/4a7c7b8fe8bcca1f2a8205a01ae31c69.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/4a7c7b8fe8bcca1f2a8205a01ae31c69.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A living 90s net<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of sites, chat rooms full of arguments, newsletters, spam, dodgy downloads and the viruses that come with them.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your own games<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D, tile maps or full 3D in the same language. Pack them onto floppies and share them. Everything you make stays compatible with future updates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras\/57c6289a7f7e1b3872072b51bb01f9c1.avif?t=1793764512\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/extras_big\/57c6289a7f7e1b3872072b51bb01f9c1.avif?t=1793764512 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop or VR<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play flat with mouse and keyboard, or sit at the desk in VR.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your PC belongs to VRK Systems. So does the world outside.<\/i><\/p>","short_description":"March 1991. Your brother Levan is gone, but his PC still boots and his mailbox still gets work. Fix code for clients, break into servers on a hidden network, write and share your own games on a programmable 90s PC, and follow what he left behind. Desktop or VR.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/9c2035eed988c0e49c9051c20a7dcacc87c8d221\/header.jpg?t=1793764512","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/17dad62d215a690096e3d1c0efbfa1febadaadb7\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793764512","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5418530\/17dad62d215a690096e3d1c0efbfa1febadaadb7\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793764512","website":"https:\/\/vrkemono.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> OpenXR (SteamVR or Meta Quest Link runtime). Headsets: Meta Quest 2\/3\/3S\/Pro via Link, Air Link or Steam Link; Valve Index; Windows Mixed Reality \/ HP Reverb G2. Controllers: Meta Quest Touch, Valve Index, WMR \/ HP Reverb G2 motion controllers. HTC Vive wands not supported. Seated or standing, small play area. VR optional – fully playable on a flat screen.<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Keyboard and mouse recommended for writing code. Flat mode is less demanding than VR.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["VRKemono"],"publishers":["VRKemono"],"demos":[{"appid":5472480,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":969,"final":678,"discount_percent":30,"initial_formatted":"9,69€","final_formatted":"6,78€"},"packages":[1870480],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Retro Coder 2000","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1870480,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Retro Coder 2000 - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">9,69€<\/span> 6,78€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","i